{"parse": {"title": "Rusty sword", "pageid": 15652, "revid": 15183727, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{External|rs|rsc}}\n{{Infobox Item\n|name = Rusty sword\n|image = [[File:Rusty sword.png]]\n|release = [[9 July]] [[2003]]\n|update = New Digsite Quest!\n|members = Yes\n|quest = No\n|tradeable = No\n|equipable = No\n|stackable = No\n|noteable = No\n|options = Drop\n|examine = A decent-enough weapon gone rusty.\n|value = 1\n|weight = 2.267\n|id = 686\n}}\n[[File:Rusty sword detail.png|left|70px]]\nA '''rusty sword''' is a broken sword that can be repaired by bringing it to [[Tindel Marchant]] in [[Port Khazard]] and paying 100 [[coins]] or repaired on a [[whetstone]] or on an [[armour stand]] in a [[Player-owned house]] [[workshop]].{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|date=29 November 2022|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1597575827310379014|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/100532|archivedate=5 December 2022}} All three options have a chance to break the sword, however the chance of it breaking on the whetstone or armour stand decreases with Smithing level.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/831543833309675521|date=14 February 2017|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/104304|archivedate=19 December 2021|quote=Your Smithing level controls the chance of breaking it, but has no bearing on what sword it becomes if you succeed.}} Successfully repairing a rusty sword yields 25 [[Smithing]] [[experience]].\n\nThe easiest way for low-level players to obtain a rusty sword is by pickpocketing [[H.A.M. Member]]s (requires 15 [[Thieving]], reached by picking the [[H.A.M. Hideout]] trapdoor), killing [[H.A.M. Guard|H.A.M. Guards]] (levels 12, 18, 22, reached by the same method), or by playing [[Fishing Trawler]] (Requires 15 [[Fishing]]). Alternatively, it can be obtained from [[#Item sources|monster drops]] or at the [[Digsite]] after partial completion of [[The Dig Site]] quest.\n\n==Possible rewards (Tindel Marchant)==\n{{DropLogProject|jagex=yes}}\n\n{{Average drop value|mob=Rusty sword#Tindel Marchant|mobname=rusty sword|killname=repair}}\n{{DropsTableHead|dropversion=Tindel Marchant|leagueRegion=Kandarin}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Iron sword|quantity=1|rarity=20/100}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Iron longsword|quantity=1|rarity=37/100}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Bronze sword|quantity=1|rarity=17/100}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Bronze longsword|quantity=1|rarity=7/100}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Steel sword|quantity=1|rarity=6/100}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Steel longsword|quantity=1|rarity=4/100}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Mithril sword|quantity=1|rarity=1/100}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Mithril longsword|quantity=1|rarity=1/100}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Black sword|quantity=1|rarity=3/100}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Black longsword|quantity=1|rarity=2/100}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Coins|quantity=1500-1999|rarity=1/100}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Nothing|rarity=1/100}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n==Possible rewards (POH repair)==\n{{Skill info\n|skill1name = Smithing\n|skill1lvl = 1\n|skill1exp = 25\n|facility = [[Whetstone]], [[Armour stand]]\n|dropversion = POH repair\n}}\n\nThere is a chance of breaking the rusty sword and receiving nothing. The success rate is higher with a higher Smithing level.\n\n{{DropLogProject|jagex=yes|success=yes}}\n{{Skilling success chart|label=Rusty sword repair chance|xlabel=Smithing level\n|label1=Rusty sword|low1=100|high1=240|color1=chocolate|image1=Rusty sword.png\n}}\n\n{{DropLogProject|jagex=yes}}\n\n{{Average drop value|mob=Rusty sword#POH repair|mobname=rusty sword|killname=repair}}\n{{DropsTableHead|dropversion=POH repair|leagueRegion=Misthalin,Karamja,Asgarnia,Fremennik,Kandarin,Desert,Morytania,Tirannwn,Wilderness,Kourend}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Iron sword|quantity=1|rarity=20/100|skill=smithing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Iron longsword|quantity=1|rarity=37/100|skill=smithing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Bronze sword|quantity=1|rarity=17/100|skill=smithing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Bronze longsword|quantity=1|rarity=7/100|skill=smithing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Steel sword|quantity=1|rarity=6/100|skill=smithing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Steel longsword|quantity=1|rarity=4/100|skill=smithing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Black sword|quantity=1|rarity=3/100|skill=smithing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Black longsword|quantity=1|rarity=2/100|skill=smithing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Mithril longsword|quantity=1|rarity=4/100|skill=smithing}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n==Uses==\n===Achievement Diary===\n*[[Ardougne Diary#Easy|Ardougne Diary (Easy)]]: Have [[Tindel Marchant]] identify a rusty sword for you. \n\n==Item sources==\n{{Drop sources|Rusty sword}}\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n{{Repair}}\n{{The Dig Site}}\n{{Fishing Trawler}}"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:22:36.578877+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unsortable\" title=\"Sort items by category, rarity and name.\"></th>\n<th style=\"border-left: none;\" class=\"item-col\">Item</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Quantity</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th class=\"ge-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th>\n<th class=\"alch-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">High Alch</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td class=\"inventory-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Iron_sword\" title=\"Iron sword\"><img alt=\"Iron sword.png: Rusty sword drops Iron sword with rarity 20/100 in quantity 1\" src=\"/images/Iron_sword.png?54303\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"31\" /></a></span></td><td class=\"item-col\" style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/w/Iron_sword\" title=\"Iron sword\">Iron sword</a></td><td data-sort-value=\"1\">1</td><td data-sort-value=\"5\" class=\"table-bg-green\" titl